# A runtime state with nothing in it, in the shape before the migration.
# Written by hand; the bytes equal the ones the runtime of the v0.30.1
# release writes for this state.

94          # the runtime state: 4 elements
  90        # no ready frames
  90        # the promise states table: no states
  92 00 80  # the select states table: next id 0, no continuations
  00        # the effect counter
